## Execution Guidance

1. Read runtime input values using the schema defined in [in.json](in.json).
2. Keep the skill focused on one concrete responsibility: {{responsibility}}
3. Use this section to document validation rules, transformation rules, edge cases, and missing-input handling that are not obvious from the flow diagram.
4. If the work is deterministic, implement it in `scripts/*.ts` and run it with Bun.
5. If reusable output patterns are needed, load them from `templates/`.
6. When a script is used, pass inputs through command-line arguments and emit structured outputs through standard output in a format aligned with [out.json](out.json).
7. If required input values are missing and cannot be derived from available context, ask the user for the missing information. Prefer constrained choices over free-text input when possible.
